flowchart TB
    classDef backend fill:#e9f8ef,stroke:#2f8f46,color:#222;
    classDef infra fill:#fff0eb,stroke:#c45a1a,color:#222;
    classDef data fill:#f5ebff,stroke:#7c49c9,color:#222;
    classDef note fill:#fff6d6,stroke:#a66c00,color:#222;

    Start[Backend startup<br/>restore cursor and validate configuration]:::backend
    Enabled{TWINT_INBOX_ENABLED?}
    Disabled[Reader disabled]:::note
    Tick[TwintMailboxScheduler<br/>one dedicated thread<br/>tick every TWINT_INBOX_POLL_MS]:::backend
    Orders[(Orders and payments<br/>persisted creation and first report timestamps)]:::data
    Active{At least one unpaid order<br/>with an open window?}
    Fast[ACTIVE<br/>default interval 5 seconds<br/>default window 10 minutes]:::backend
    Slow[PERIODIC<br/>default interval 3 hours<br/>even without unpaid orders]:::backend
    Due{First check after startup<br/>or interval elapsed<br/>since the last attempt finished?}
    Read[TwintMailboxReader<br/>cursor lock and IMAPS read<br/>bounded batch of new UIDs]:::infra
    Auth[DKIM signature and parser<br/>order reference and amount]:::backend
    Reconcile[TwintReconciliationService<br/>confirm or record review outcome]:::backend
    Saved[(Commit receipts and cursor<br/>payment and outbox if confirmed)]:::data
    Error[Roll back batch<br/>log failure]:::note
    Finish[Record attempt completion in coordinator<br/>wait for next tick]:::backend
    Note[New orders detected from database<br/>no task per order<br/>no overlapping reads]:::note

    Start --> Enabled
    Enabled -->|no| Disabled
    Enabled -->|yes| Tick
    Tick --> Orders --> Active
    Active -->|yes| Fast --> Due
    Active -->|no| Slow --> Due
    Due -->|no| Tick
    Due -->|yes| Read --> Auth --> Reconcile --> Saved --> Finish
    Read -->|connection or processing failure| Error --> Finish
    Finish --> Tick
    Note -.-> Tick
